WEBVTT

00:12:29.762 --> 00:12:31.386
It was my ex-girlfriend.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:34.870
While I was breaking the record
underwater for the first time,

00:12:34.894 --> 00:12:37.976
she was sifting through my Blackberry,
checking all my messages.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.976
(Laughter)

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.519
My brother had a picture of it.
It is really --

00:12:43.543 --> 00:12:45.155
(Laughter)

00:12:47.447 --> 00:12:48.448
(Laughter ends)

00:12:48.472 --> 00:12:52.976
I then announced that I was going
to go for Sietas' record, publicly.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.396
And what he did in response,
is he went on Regis and Kelly,

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.977
and broke his old record.